# Vars required by the openclaw service.
# Used by scripts/service-env to extract a minimal .env for deployment.
# Only these secrets reach the service; the master /opt/homelab/.env is never mounted.
#
# OPENCLAW_WORKSPACE_DEPLOY_KEY_B64: base64 ed25519 deploy key (write access) for
# github.com/technicalpickles/openclaw-workspace. deploy.sh decodes it to
# ssh/workspace_deploy_key for the one-time workspace clone. Unknown until the
# op:// ref exists in .env.template; deploy.sh degrades to no-clone with a warning.
OPENCLAW_HOST
OPENCLAW_GATEWAY_TOKEN
OLLAMA_API_KEY
OPENROUTER_API_KEY
TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN
GEMINI_API_KEY
OPENCLAW_ALLOWED_CHAT_IDS
OPENCLAW_IMAGE
OPENCLAW_WORKSPACE_DEPLOY_KEY_B64
